WEBVTT

00:00:15.091 --> 00:00:18.182
[ WIND WHISTLING ]

00:00:22.925 --> 00:00:26.233
Hermione:
"IGNOTUS PEVERELL."

00:00:28.279 --> 00:00:29.976
HEY, HARRY?

00:01:02.965 --> 00:01:05.794
[ SNIFFLES ]

00:01:05.838 --> 00:01:07.187
[ SIGHS ]

00:01:07.231 --> 00:01:10.756
[ SNIFFLES ]
MERRY CHRISTMAS, HERMIONE.

00:01:10.799 --> 00:01:13.715
MERRY CHRISTMAS, HARRY.

00:01:33.431 --> 00:01:36.390
HARRY,
THERE'S SOMEONE WATCHING US,

00:01:36.434 --> 00:01:38.697
BY THE CHURCH.

00:01:48.837 --> 00:01:52.058
I THINK I KNOW
WHO THAT IS.

00:01:52.101 --> 00:01:54.669
I DON'T LIKE THIS, HARRY.

00:01:54.713 --> 00:01:57.193
HERMIONE,
SHE KNEW DUMBLEDORE.

00:01:57.237 --> 00:01:59.195
SHE MIGHT HAVE THE SWORD.

00:02:18.084 --> 00:02:20.434
THIS IS WHERE THEY DIED,
HERMIONE.

00:02:20.478 --> 00:02:22.915
[ SCREAMING]

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:30.488
THIS IS WHERE
HE MURDERED THEM.

00:02:37.756 --> 00:02:40.324
[ FLY BUZZING ]

00:02:42.282 --> 00:02:44.850
YOU'RE BATHILDA,
AREN'T YOU?

00:02:50.159 --> 00:02:52.466
HERE.
LET ME DO THAT.

00:03:16.272 --> 00:03:17.926
MISS BAGSHOT...

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:21.277
W-WHO IS THIS MAN?

00:03:31.723 --> 00:03:32.811
Harry.

00:03:37.729 --> 00:03:40.122
Harry: LUMOS.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:12.677
[ FOOTSTEPS ]

00:04:17.203 --> 00:04:19.858
[ LOCKET CLICKING ]

00:04:27.213 --> 00:04:30.129
[ SPEAKS PARSELTONGUE ]

00:04:33.349 --> 00:04:35.656
[ SPEAKS PARSELTONGUE ]

00:04:46.493 --> 00:04:48.669
[ FLIES BUZZING ]

00:05:04.032 --> 00:05:06.861
[ CRACKING ]

00:05:06.905 --> 00:05:10.474
[ GASPING ]

00:05:10.517 --> 00:05:13.041
[ CLANGING ]

00:05:15.914 --> 00:05:17.916
[ HISSING ]

00:05:19.744 --> 00:05:21.180
HARRY!

